0971  EB EC
                          LABEL PUT$       \ write the counted text at CS:DX; uses AX BX CX DX
0973  89 D3 2E 8A 0F 30     BX DX MOV,  CS: CL 0 [BX] MOV,  CH CH XOR,  DX INC,  WRITE-CS JMP,
0979  ED 42 EB E2
