097D  89 D3 31 C9           BX DX MOV,  CX CX XOR,
0981  2E 80 3F 00 74 04     BEGIN,  CS: 0 [BX] BYTE 0 CMPI,  NZ WHILE,  BX INC,  CX INC,  REPEAT,
0987  43 41 EB F6
098B  EB D2                 WRITE-CS JMP,
