0A50  52 BA 31 08 E8 1C     DX PUSH,  DX UCF$ MOVI,  PUT$ CALL,  CS: DX CUR-NAME [] MOV,  PUTZ CALL,
0A56  FF 2E 8B 16 5B 07
0A5C  E8 1E FF
0A5F  5A E8 10 FF E8 05     DX POP,  PUT$ CALL,  NEWLINE CALL,  AL 1 MOVI,  EXIT-DOS JMP,
0A65  FF B0 01 EB B1
                          
                          \ ==== The clock =========================================================
                          \ The BIOS counts 1193180 / 65536 = 18.2 ticks per second at 0040:006C.
                          \ A tick is 54.925 ms = 56244 / 1024 ms, so ms = ticks * 56244 / 1024.
                          
                          LABEL TICKS      \ AX: the tick counter of the BIOS, the low 16 bits
0A6A  06 B8 40 00 8E C0     ES PUSH,  AX $40 MOVI,  ES AX MOV,  ES: AX $6C [] MOV,  ES POP,  RET,
0A70  26 A1 6C 00 07 C3
                          LABEL NOW        \ AX: milliseconds since the start, modulo 65536; uses CX DX
0A76  E8 F1 FF 2E 2B 06     TICKS CALL,  CS: AX START-TICKS [] SUB,
0A7C  45 07
0A7E  B9 B4 DB F7 E1        CX 56244 MOVI,  CX MUL,                                 \ DX:AX = ticks * 56244
0A83  B1 0A D3 E8 B1 06     CL 10 MOVI,  AX CL SHR,  CL 6 MOVI,  DX CL SHL,  AX DX OR,   \ / 1024
0A89  D3 E2 09 D0
0A8D  C3                    RET,
                          
