0B16  2E A1 69 07 2E 8B     CS: AX XT-REFILL [] MOV,  CS: DX REFILL-END [] MOV,  BX BP MOV,  CX 8 MOVI,
0B1C  16 6B 07 89 EB B9
0B22  08 00
                            BEGIN,
